# This folder doubles as an Obsidian vault for daily working notes/context.
# Those notes should stay local and never end up in the public site repo,
# so everything is ignored by default and only the actual site files are
# explicitly allowed back in below. Add new site files/folders here as
# the site grows.

*

!/.gitignore
!/.nojekyll
!/404.html
!/README.md
!/HANDOFF_PROMPT.md
!/index.html
!/llms.txt
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/assets/
!/assets/**
!/docs/
!/docs/**
!/experience/
!/experience/**
!/modules/
!/modules/**
!/atlas/
!/atlas/index.html
!/vault/
!/vault/index.html
!/notes/
!/notes/index.html
!/notes/README.md
!/island/
!/island/index.html
!/tools/
# The portfolio tracker moved to its own private repo (stock-trackers) on
# 2026-09-15, so nothing under tools/tracker/ is allowlisted any more.
# Tests match by pattern so a new test file cannot be swallowed again.
!/tools/tests/
!/tools/tests/*.test.js
!/tools/obsidian-sync.js
/docs/STOCK_UPDATE_PROMPT.md
